The <a href="/site/apidocs/org/apache/juneau/marshall/json5l/Json5lSerializer.html" target="_blank">Json5lSerializer</a> converts POJOs to JSON5L, and the <a href="/site/apidocs/org/apache/juneau/marshall/json5l/Json5lParser.html" target="_blank">Json5lParser</a> creates POJOs from JSON5L by parsing each line as a JSON5 value.

